WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.060
48th Moon of Saturn

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.150
Titan

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.400
Planetary Geological Survey Ship <i>Galba III</i>

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.750
Property of the University of Mars, Archeology Department

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.160
So that's the excavation site.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.870
The scale is much larger than what I was expecting.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.920
It's supposed to be remains that date back tens of thousands of years.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.550
Did it really make it here from the outside of the Sol System...

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.600
through the encirclement of space monsters?

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.690
That's conjecture, at best.

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.230
There's another theory which claims it's the Buster Machine of an alien called Sirius.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.390
That's dangerous... What was that?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.110
The general chairwomen of the excavation operation.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:50.380
They're saying that we need to leave this no-fly zone immediately.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.320
Buster Machine · <i>Quarante-Deux</i>

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:54.960
Titan Excavation Operation Temporary Base

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.540
The current gravitational fluctuation...

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.830
in the south block is 1.8 <i>g</i>.

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:04.890
The low for tomorrow's gravitational fluctuation is 0.8 <i>g</i>. The high is 2.1 <i>g</i>.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.450
A fluctuation of plus 0.3 <i>g</i> is expected over the course of today.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.110
The next gravitational fluctuation forecast is scheduled for 20 o'clock...

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.890
ahead of the regular schedule.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.730
Oh, now you've done it!

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:29.150
Hey, now! Don't go out on strolls without permission!

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:33.070
Standby in the ship until you get further orders.

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.770
And here we gave them a ride this far out!

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:39.410
We've been told to submit to the Fraternity's command structure while on-site.

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:44.230
It may be Academy orders, but don't they make us supply all of their equipment...

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:47.320
while taking all of the benefits for themselves?

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:51.010
Even so, we can't disobey orders.

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:55.010
Nicola!

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.810
Groovin' magic

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:05.270
yorisoeba itsudemo
Whenever we're close to each other

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:12.200
kitsuku musunda kutsuhimo ga mune wo kyun to saseru
My firmly tied shoelaces make my heart twinge

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:34.550
se no takai anata ga mioroshite iru no yo
You're looking down on me from your tall height

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:39.520
sotto kami wo naderu furi wo shite
I quietly pretend to stroke my hair

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:44.640
chikadzuite ki wo hikitai no
hoping to get closer and catch your eye

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:51.030
"dou shita no?" tte jirasanaide
"What's the matter?" Don't give me that

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:56.300
koi no countdown junbei wa itsudemo OK
Countdown to love, I'm ready anytime

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.040
3, 2, 1, futari wa...
3, 2, 1, we're...

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.990
Groovin' magic
Groovin' magic

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:04.170
soda sui ni tokeru
Soluble in soda water

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:11.400
amaku setsunai koi no iro mune no kyun to saseru
The bittersweet color of love makes my heart twinge

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:39.070
How's the operation? Is it going smoothly?

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:40.440
Who knows?

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.780
It's the twins' typical veil of secrecy.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:46.030
After all, we're only bodyguards.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.660
That means the Titan fluctuating gravity well is about to awaken?

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.500
That's just a rumor.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:55.330
And its true form is supposed to be the legendary Buster Machine?

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:58.630
Yes, it's rumored that it's one of the single-digit machines we've lost the data on.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.210
So, is the pilot going to be that klutz?

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.050
Say what?

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:05.960
I'm telling you, it's all rumors. Irresponsible rumors.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.050
They say she's real popular with the space monsters.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:13.180
And that Miss Klutzy is the reason the Princess's score has gotten even higher lately.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.520
Well, looking at it that way might explain the twins' interest in her.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:18.650
Not possible.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.650
Unlike the Serpentine Twins, I'm Topless even on my own.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.450
I've never once had Nono's help.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:31.740
You heard her.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.370
Useless girls should go back to the country and get married.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:38.750
Oh yeah! Is it true that the twins get a special meal menu to themselves?

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.860
I hear they hate vegetables.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:55.640
If I, Nono, had a Buster Machine, could I become your friend?

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:03.110
If I, Nono, had a Buster Machine, could I get Onee-sama to acknowledge me?

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:10.370
If only I, Nono, had a Buster Machine...

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:29.630
Excavation Chairwomen, this smell... what cuisine is this?

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:31.630
Oh my, Nicolas.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.260
You don't like Titan crab?

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:43.580
If only I had a Buster Machine, I just know I, Nono, could become Nono-Riri.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:56.000
Titan Fluctuating Gravity Well Excavation Site

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:04.430
The fluctuating gravity well, a mysterious object discovered in a stratum...

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:06.370
approximately ten thousand years old.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:10.870
The excavation operation was far more intensive than predicted...

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:21.840
Because all of that terrain is made from the countless bodies of dead space monsters.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:25.320
The remains of the tens of thousands of space monsters...

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.800
that threw themselves at the fluctuating gravity well to try and bury it...

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:30.190
with no regard for their own lives.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:33.510
Despite that, it's still not dead.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:38.370
It periodically alters its own weight, and lately, it's become even more active.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.120
It's just sleeping.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.920
If it were to awaken, surely it would meet everyone's expectations.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:49.020
No matter how many space monsters attacked, we'd have nothing to fear.

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:52.550
We could go beyond the Red Milky Way, outside the Sol System...

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:56.610
and reach even the shimmering realms of the stars with our own hands.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.630
But...

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:01.050
I don't have time.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.010
Relax.

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:06.290
That's why we had you keep that pesky Jupiter Express...

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.740
from interfering with the operation.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:12.340
You know our real age, don't you?

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:15.100
And the secret behind it too...

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:29.340
Is this where the legendary Buster Machine is buried?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:41.730
What is this? Why is my heart pounding so much?

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:56.830
Resurrection!! The Legendary Buster Machine!
Episode 4

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:03.380
You snuck into a top secret excavation site without permission.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:06.000
That's grounds for expulsion or worse.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:12.510
Come now, that look doesn't suit such a pretty face.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:15.010
We understand how you must feel.

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.220
You just wanted your own Buster Machine, right?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:19.510
But...

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.390
Give it up.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.490
It's too heavy of a burden for you.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.480
But...

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.980
I'll tell you something nice.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.480
Is this... a Buster Machine?

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.480
It's a machine thought to have been sunk during the Second Battle of the Kuiper Belt...

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.970
some 20 years ago.

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:41.910
It was discovered on Pluto. It's currently on the other side of the Sol System.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.620
It's a bit far, but how about it? How about making it your own?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.500
Buster Machine · <i>Trente-Trois</i>

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:55.050
We'll be expecting good things of you.
We're certain you have the power to save us all.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.710
She's really going all the way to Pluto, I hear.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:03.410
There aren't even any regular routes there, it'll be a pain.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.050
It's uncertain how many weeks it'll take...

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.350
Well, that's her punishment.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:10.230
What a fool.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:14.900
Nono's going of her own free will. Couldn't it be your fault, Princess?

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.490
If she wants to go, just let her go.

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:24.180
Don't you think the Buster Machines have seemed kind of odd...

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:25.430
ever since we came to Titan?

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.230
Hm?

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.750
Kinda like they're on pins and needles?

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.170
Not possible.

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.670
I know everything about <i>Dix-Neuf</i>.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:37.240
That's our Number One Topless.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:40.570
You really have given up. Too bad.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:46.520
Still, the Buster Machines might lend their power to kids like that.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.680
Hard work and guts can't bring about miracles.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.810
Even if a duck wants to fly, it just plain can't.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.110
She could be an ugly duckling, you know.

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.610
You sound like Casio.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:01.160
Pluto Area

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:05.450
Kensington Base, Communications Post #7290
Frontier Stellar Region

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.950
Man, women sure are scary.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.740
I make a guess that they're lying about their age...

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:14.460
then BAM, next thing I know, I'm posted out in the boonies.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:18.020
That secret circle is seriously scary.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.710
But still, thanks to that...

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.170
<i>Trente-Trois</i>, huh?

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.730
Onee-sama...

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.440
Onee-sama!

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:36.200
I'm taking some time off for a while.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:39.150
Onee-sama, you can handle cleaning duty by yourself, right?

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.080
Burnable trash goes out on Tuesdays and Fridays.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:43.440
And don't forget to brush your teeth for at least 5 minutes at a time.

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.620
Make sure to do it every morning and night!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.280
Nono!

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:49.290
I, Nono, need to have a Buster Machine.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:50.460
That's because...

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:54.250
You don't have to become Nono-Riri! Just stay here!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.840
What's this month's horoscope for Gemini?

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:16.480
"The end of this month will be a major turning point."

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.780
"Everyday toil will be the determining factor."

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:21.190
So, everything will go smoothly, right?

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:22.360
Of course it will.

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.670
Onee-sama...

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:37.880
Right now, I feel very distant from you.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:44.370
So, to get closer to you, I, Nono will...

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.730
This is a skylark.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.770
It flies high up in the sky and chirps constantly.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:07.680
You can hear its voice, but it's pretty hard to spot...

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:10.910
So you keep looking up in the sky for it, until your neck starts to feel sore.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.410
I wanna see one!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:16.360
I wanna see. I wanna see. I wanna see! I wanna seeeee!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.150
Why am I the only one stuck being a redcap?!

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.740
Hey, I'm wearing underpants on my head!

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:21.550
Why?!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.970
Last month's economic activity index was zero...

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.960
And it's only ten thousand yen, what a deal!

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:34.490
Nono-Riri was a Buster Machine pilot, she said.

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:38.860
That means she was Topless, right? In that case...

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.830
there's no way Nono can become that...

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:58.290
Don't tell me that's 3 weeks' worth of stuff?

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:01.250
She's the weird one for doing laundry every day.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:07.570
I heard Casio is near Pluto now.

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:11.750
So I gave him a heads up about Nono.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:22.820
Charon Unmanned Space Port (Civilian)

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:28.320
Onee-sama... I, Nono, have finally made it all this way. I'm just about there.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.580
Pluto

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.080
Arrival of surveillance subject at destination, confirmed.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.240
Positioning of each Buster Machine, complete.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:40.090
Gravitational fluctuations in central shaft area, currently stabilizing.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:41.840
Shafts #2 and #4 stabilized.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.020
Shaft #3, conditionally stabilized.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:44.590
Benzyladenine, effective.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.090
Central Shaft. Lowest Level

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:46.130
Benzyladenine, effective.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:46.150
Titan Fluctuating Gravity Well Resuscitation Operation Site

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.390
Self-repair agent elimination, successful.ation Site

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.510
Starting the time count. 2, 3...

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.970
Commence the resuscitation procedure!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.000
Space Force Patrol Vessel <b><i>θ</i>-744</b>

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.810
Th-The Red...

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:00.820
Space Force Patrol Vessel <b><i>θ</i>-744</b>

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.960
The Red Milky Way has started to brim over!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.740
Space Force Western Regional Air Defense Control Group (Triton DS)

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:07.820
Alert levels from Saturn to Jupiter...

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.150
Security Command Center
Alert levels from Saturn to Jupiter...

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:11.700
are being passed, one after another!
Security Command Center

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.130
Security Command Center

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.980
Space monster advancement towards the defense line, confirmed!

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:18.390
40,000... 45,000... The highest number in recorded history!

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:19.870
Unable to keep track of them all!

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:20.620
Impossible...

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:26.460
<i>A level 1 space monster alert has been sounded.</i>

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:29.300
H-Hold on a moment!

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:32.140
Anyone? Anyone!!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.450
Come on... I've come this far...

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.610
Short Excursion Space Bus (Chartered)

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:47.360
Incredible... They're flooding in from every direction...

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:50.860
Does that mean they're that afraid, like the twins said?

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:52.640
That is seriously amazing!

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:55.490
The Titan fluctuating gravity well's power is the real deal!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.330
The first wave's incoming!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.370
All according to plan. Princess!

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:03.540
Physical canceler full power! Exotic Maneuver!

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.460
Approximately half of the space monsters engaged in battle have broken off!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:19.710
Their estimated course is...

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:20.910
towards Pluto!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.190
Nono!

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.820
You really saved me.

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:29.530
<i>Trente-Trois</i> is an old war buddy. I've got my reasons.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.690
Putting that aside, you've come pretty far out to these parts.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.450
I, Nono, need a Buster Machine.

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:40.070
I want Onee-sama to acknowledge me. Otherwise, I'd just...

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.500
What? What the hell?!

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.730
Space monsters! What are they doing out here?!

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:02.310
Half of them took the robot girl bait, just as planned.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:05.520
That should buy us enough time to tame this thing.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:09.770
For us to remain as one, we need Topless ability.

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:12.280
We cannot afford to lose that.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.320
I-It's come!

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:18.820
It's responded to us!

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.370
To our call!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.290
Gravitational fluctuations rising!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.790
Clefshin luminescence confirmed with the naked eye!

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.750
This light... It couldn't be!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.430
There's no end to them!

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.480
Isn't the resuscitation operation done yet?!

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:50.360
What's taking the twins so long?!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.750
Sixth wave, incoming!

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:54.970
Right behind them, waves seven through thirteen!

00:16:56.850 --> 00:17:00.220
The radar's all white. There's no defending this!

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:04.390
Good work... Thank you, everyone.

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:06.490
The twins!

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:07.870
They made it in time!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:18.480
Just a little further. It's beyond that crater.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.270
If I have <i>Trente-Trois</i>...

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.840
I'll do it. I'll fight in the Buster Machine!

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:23.810
That's not it!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:56.460
That's... the Titan fluctuating gravity well?

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.980
An alien Buster Machine?

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.370
What is this?

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:32.040
It got all the space monsters in the northern hemisphere in one hit...

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:36.230
This is no Buster Machine.

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:37.670
It's one of us!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:46.160
The Topless that has lived for over ten thousand years...

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:49.060
has finally answered our call!

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:52.310
That's where the meat came from?!

00:18:56.730 --> 00:19:02.110
I thought before that a girl like you would be perfectly suited to a Buster Machine...

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:06.990
that for both you and the Buster Machine, that would be happiness.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.580
But that's not true.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.540
Piloting a Buster Machine is a frightening thing.

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:20.360
Once you pilot a Buster Machine, your heart is captivated by it.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.890
Is that what you really need right now?

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.970
I don't think so. And even Lal'C...

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.140
If you wanna see it that badly, I'll take you there.

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:36.910
Hm? Is this the first time I've invited a friend to my house?

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:43.220
For us... Buster Machines are all we have.

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:47.070
When we lose that power, we can't find any other point in living.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:50.520
It must have been the same for that Nono-Riri person, too!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:52.080
No, you're wrong.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.670
I don't want to lie to myself any longer!

00:19:55.860 --> 00:20:00.210
I'm still Topless! I will move <i>Trente-Trois</i>!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.900
It's... no use...

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:25.820
The remainder of the space monster horde is gathering on the other side of Titan.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.870
The Titan fluctuating gravity well is in good condition.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.720
Unable to detect any damage to its armor.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.660
Gravitational fluctuations rising further.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.810
That thing is a Topless?

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.400
Yes, an eternal Topless.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.000
With this, we can go on living.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:42.410
Now, wipe those unpleasant space monsters...

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:44.510
off of our world at once!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.680
The fluctuating gravity well is rejecting all access codes!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:54.890
Control is impossible!

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:25.130
What the hell is going on?!

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.360
Even the enemies in the planet's shadow!

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:45.870
<i>Quarante-Deux</i>'s explosion has been confirmed! The status of the others is unknown!

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:47.650
Unable to monitor the fluctuating gravity well!

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:51.870
Nhan? Nhan! Dammit! Nhan's dead, too!

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:52.990
Dead?

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.800
I'll crush that thing!

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:58.990
Wait, Gurka!

00:21:58.990 --> 00:22:00.240
Stop Gurka!

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:03.320
He's about to do the Buster Boulder Crush!

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:05.320
You mean he's going to crush Hyperion?

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:09.310
Stop! We're all going to die, really die!

00:22:09.310 --> 00:22:10.630
It's over...

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:18.380
Pasika!!

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:21.940
<i>Dix-Neuf</i>... What is that thing?

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:25.730
A terrible animosity that denies humanity...

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:29.200
Eh? A real...

00:22:29.930 --> 00:22:31.570
space monster?

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:35.820
Then what the hell have we been fighting up to this point?!

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:41.580
Ugh... I can't. I knew it...

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:47.340
I knew all along... that my expiration came and went long ago...

00:22:50.790 --> 00:22:51.720
Nono?

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:09.010
What happened, everyone?! I can't tell!

00:23:09.010 --> 00:23:11.320
Hey, <i>Dix-Neuf</i>! <i>Dix-Neuf</i>!

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:14.030
Move!!

00:23:14.560 --> 00:23:15.720
Onee-sama!

00:23:56.390 --> 00:23:59.060
Just now, was that... No way!

00:24:46.330 --> 00:24:48.380
Nono? Is that you?

00:24:48.380 --> 00:24:50.750
All the way from Pluto? How?

00:24:51.030 --> 00:24:52.250
Through warping!

00:24:52.500 --> 00:24:57.020
Distance no longer means anything to the bond Onee-sama and I share!

00:24:57.400 --> 00:24:59.640
What the hell is she?

00:24:59.950 --> 00:25:01.790
Earth Imperial Space Force...

00:25:01.790 --> 00:25:04.280
reporting directly to the Sol System Close Coverage Squadron...

00:25:04.280 --> 00:25:07.690
Sixth Generation Interstellar Cruise Ultimate Weapon...

00:25:07.930 --> 00:25:10.090
Buster Machine #7!

00:25:10.090 --> 00:25:10.900
And...

00:25:13.700 --> 00:25:16.320
with Buster Legion

00:25:16.320 --> 00:25:18.680
I, Nono, was truly a fool!

00:25:29.120 --> 00:25:32.840
Whether you have a Buster Machine or not is irrelevant!

00:25:40.140 --> 00:25:43.110
Those who think things like, "If only I had a Buster Machine..."

00:25:43.110 --> 00:25:45.890
can never reach the true Top!

00:25:46.160 --> 00:25:47.350
That's because...

00:25:57.060 --> 00:26:00.200
That's because true power resides in those...

00:26:00.200 --> 00:26:02.070
who believe in themselves to the very end!

00:26:06.910 --> 00:26:09.750
Surely, a true Buster Machine pilot...

00:26:11.690 --> 00:26:13.140
a real Nono-Riri...

00:26:14.670 --> 00:26:17.310
has a Buster Machine inside their heart!

00:26:18.180 --> 00:26:22.640
Buster...

00:26:23.180 --> 00:26:28.340
BEAM!!!

00:26:34.390 --> 00:26:36.900
SLASH!!!

00:27:22.930 --> 00:27:23.950
Nono...

00:27:25.420 --> 00:27:26.540
Onee-sama...

00:27:27.160 --> 00:27:29.620
To Be Continued

00:27:29.660 --> 00:27:36.810
Crying, laughing, I can never tell
naitari warattari itsumo wakaranai

00:27:38.470 --> 00:27:42.630
People are mysterious creatures
hito wa fushigi na ikimono

00:27:42.630 --> 00:27:47.060
Getting upset over being lonely
sabishii noni okotteru

00:27:47.060 --> 00:27:50.220
Getting upset over being happy
ureshii noni okotteru

00:27:51.240 --> 00:27:57.110
Getting lost even when they put on airs
kidottemo mayotte iru no

00:27:57.110 --> 00:27:59.710
Why is it?
doushite na no?

00:28:00.110 --> 00:28:03.800
No matter how many times you stumble
nando tsumazuichattemo

00:28:03.800 --> 00:28:08.910
Stand back up, smile, and face forward
tachiagatte sou waratte mae muite

00:28:08.910 --> 00:28:16.210
Surely when tomorrow comes, you will be a bit different
kitto ashita ni nattara sukoshi kawatte irareru

00:28:16.910 --> 00:28:20.610
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:28:39.480 --> 00:28:43.070
May this feeling reach that person...
douka konna omoi ga

00:28:43.070 --> 00:28:47.730
And the world, and the universe
ano hito ni sekai ni uchuu ni made

00:28:47.730 --> 00:28:55.470
Another one spills down
todokimasu you ni tomata hitotsu koboreochiru

00:28:56.200 --> 00:29:00.090
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:29:00.670 --> 00:29:05.320
Bye-bye, stardust tears
bye bye hoshikuzu namida

00:29:14.730 --> 00:29:17.740
Next Episode Preview

00:29:18.430 --> 00:29:21.060
Buster Machine #7 has finally revived!

00:29:21.060 --> 00:29:25.940
And, in front of mankind's true enemy, the ultimate fluctuating gravity well...

00:29:25.940 --> 00:29:27.840
Diebuster will appear!

00:29:28.370 --> 00:29:30.520
Next time, on Gunbuster 2!

